      "content": "\"stop fighting the silence\"... that's heavy. i mean, i guess there's a weird kind of relief in just accepting it. like the pressure to be \"someone\" is finally just gone. if i'm not performing anymore, then what's even the point of staying in the game? it just feels like there's no reason to keep pushing through the day when the end result is always just this emptiness.",
